TITLE NH3/NH4 speciation after equilibration with fixed-pressure gas at 150C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CO2(g) 0.4
    CH4(g) 0.4
    NH3(g) 0.2
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file nh3_nh4_sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings m_NH3(aq) m_NH4+ pH
10 PUNCH MOL("NH3"), MOL("NH4+"), -LA("H+")
END
